      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "Town elders have informed me that celebrated author Treeio Florstab has fled his home village after a series of critical maulings in the intergalactic press. His writing tutor, one Glitch Professor Irondome, was found with a copy of Florstab's debut novel, Floran Peace, rammed into his mouth."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "町の長老たちは、有名な作家であるTreeio Florstabが、銀河間報道機関で一連の重大な被害を受けた後、彼の故郷の村から逃げ出したことを私に知らせました。 彼の著作家アイアンドーム教授は、フロルスタブの小説『フロラン・ピース』の写しを口に突っ込んだ状態で発見された。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "Thankfully the Glitch was okay, although I'm told he occasionally quotes pretentious dialogue following the incident. Florstab apparently told the Glitch professor that he'd make sure the universe would 'remember my name.'"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "幸いにも、このグリッチは大丈夫でしたが、彼はたまにこの事件の後の気取らない会話を引用していると言われています。 Florstabさんは、宇宙が私の名前を覚えていないことを確認すると、グリッチ教授に話したそうです。'"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "As such, I have no choice but to suspend any and all attempts at teaching the Florans to write, in case we encounter any further murderous delusions of grandeur."
    },
